## Execution Boundary

Faithful planning, implementation, validation, local commits, known work-environment deployment,
and changed-behavior verification may continue through work2. This roadmap does not authorize a
push, tag, GitHub Release, production release formalization, credential change, destructive
retirement, or cross-workspace client mutation. The root Idea loop stays open until the remaining
G6 evidence is separately authorized and reconciled.

